{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t一艘由上環開往蛇口的客輪早上約9時半駛至青衣油庫對開時，懷疑撞到船塢設施，船上22人受傷，其中5人傷勢較嚴重，分別送往瑪嘉烈醫院及仁濟醫院。<br/>\n<br/>\n事發後，客輪停泊於青衣船塢的碼頭，現場所見，客輪船頭有損毀。多輛救護車到場，將傷者送院，警方在場調查。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T05:23:57.383075+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T05:07:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T10:37:38.468126+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T05:17:29.804364+00:00","content_hash":"1ca96d7d18c9a267ced4191a747c8c1a2f8fcfe4afe5cd33f2202bf57b2554d6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}